      "why": "freeze_packages.sh installs each file of contrib/requirements into a fresh venv, then writes everything installed, with hashes, to the file of the same name in contrib/deterministic-build. So a package the source file names is one Electrum asks for; any other pinned package came in with them. It installs pip, setuptools and wheel itself, for every file. Checked at 4.8.4; another version of the script needs a new review.",
